            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.65</h2><ul><li>Adds Android-aware phone pairing and Realtime bridge support.</li><li>Defaults Companion pairing to OAuth (ChatGPT Subscription) with API-key fallback off.</li><li>Accepts client-provided Realtime session payloads and forwards VAD sensitivity to GPT-Realtime-2.</li><li>Updates pairing copy from iPhone-only wording to phone-neutral wording.</li></ul>
]]></description>
